[37.279, "o", "I’ll query `sfagent-dev` for available Agentforce agents, then use the returned API name to run the requested preview turn.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mlist_agents started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mlist_agents (completed)\u001b[0m\r\n`sfagent-dev` has one agent: `Agentforce_Service_Agent`. I’m starting a headless preview session with that agent now.\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mstart_session started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mstart_session (completed)\u001b[0m\r\nThe session is active. I’m sending the exact prompt now: `Can you help me with my order?`\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1msend_message started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1msend_message (completed)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "The agent responded and asked for identity verification before order help. I’m ending the preview session to close out the test.\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mend_session started\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m \u001b[1mend_session (completed)\u001b[0m\r\nTest completed in `sfagent-dev`.\r\n\r\nAgent listed:\r\n`Agentforce_Service_Agent` - Agentforce Service Agent\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "Session:\r\n`019e5aa3-4f55-74d4-a8cf-597b79882be0`\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "Prompt sent:\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "`Can you help me with my order?`\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\nAgent response:\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "“Sure! Before I can assist you with your order, I need to verify your identity. Could you please provide your email address or username?”\r\n\r\nSession ended successfully.\r\n18,651\r\nTest completed in `sfagent-dev`.\r\n\r\nAgent listed:\r\n`Agentforce_Service_Agent` - Agentforce Service Agent\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\nSession:\r\n`019e5aa3-4f55-74d4-a8cf-597b79882be0`\r\n\r\nPrompt sent:\r\n`Can you help me with my order?`\r\n\r\nAgent response:\r\n"]
